10. Coach/Gym Seat Licensing
This is the "gym pays for N client seats" model — separate from the marketplace in §11. The key design decision: a coach's real-world clients connect by invite, not by search. Discover is for strangers finding a coach; an invite is for a coach connecting the clients they already have.

